                <pb facs="0423" n="311" sameAs="frus:frus1910/pg311"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 774/775.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Netherlands Minister to
                        the Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Netherlands Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Bar Harbor,
                                Me.</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1910-08-06"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">August 6,
                    1910</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Am instructed inform your excellency that Chinese Government having urgently
                    requested postponement, my Government will propose later date for convening
                    opium conference.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Loudon.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
